ि-ण्˚).", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परीणाहः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["parIRAhaH"]}], "pariRahavat": [{"id": "pariRAhavat", "headword": "परिणाहवत्", "headword_slp1": "pariRAhavat", "fold": "pariRahavat", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "परि-णाह—वत् mfn. = expensive, large, Vikr.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परिणाहवन्त्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["pariRAhavant"]}], "pariRahin": [{"id": "pariRAhin", "headword": "परिणाहिन्", "headword_slp1": "pariRAhin", "fold": "pariRahin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "परि-णा˚हिन् mfn. id., Hariv.; Kum.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(ifc.) having the extent of, as large as, Pañc.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "pariRi": [{"id": "pariRi", "headword": "परिणि", "headword_slp1": "pariRi", "fold": "pariRi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "परि-णि for परि-नि, according to Pāṇ. viii, 4, 17 before a number of roots, viz. गद्, चि, दा, दिह्, द्रा, धा (see below), नद्, पत्, पद्, प्सा, मा, मे, यम्, या, वप्, वह्, विश् (see below), शम्, सो, हन् (see below).", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "pariRI", "headword": "परिणी", "headword_slp1": "pariRI", "fold": "pariRi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "परि-णी (√ नी) P. Ā. -णयति, ˚ते (pf. Ā. -णिन्ये, Daś.; -णयाम् आस, MBh.; 3. pl. aor. -अनेषत, RV.; ind.p. -णीय, Kum.),\nto lead or bear or carry about or round, RV. &c. &c., (esp.) to lead a bride and bridegroom round the sacrificial fire (with 2 acc.)\nto marry (said of a bridegroom), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;\nto lead forward to, put or place anywhere (अग्रम्, at the head), Br.;\nto carry away, RV.;\nto trace out, discover, investigate, Mn.; MBh.;\n (with अन्यथा) to explain otherwise, Śaṃk. :\nCaus. -णाययति, to pass or spend (time), MBh.;\n (also णापयति), to cause a man to marry a woman (acc.), Pañcad.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "pariRinsaka": [{"id": "pariRiMsaka", "headword":